Here is my first pass at a restructured Artillery Duel BASIC Listing.  Since the formatting will probably get screwed up in this posting, I've also attached the document in Rich Text Format.  Each line has been broken-up after each separate statement on a line (a semi-colon separates commands in AstroBASIC rather than a colon like in most other BASIC versions).  Despite me working on "commenting" the program, this is only a simple restructuring to make the program more readable.  However, it already makes the program a bit more self-commenting.  Thankfully!

Artillery Duel
By John Perkins
AstroBASIC Version
Commented by Adam Trionfo
May 12, 2020.
Version 1.0

The conversion was created from an audio file called

